<title>THAILAND: Robinson 1996 net profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Robinson 1996 net profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		4.10	vs		1.31</p>
<p>    Net		     603.53	vs	    192.12</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Robinson Department Store Plc, a department store operator.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
